<title>UK: Luebecker Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Luebecker Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LUEBECKER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.125    MATURITY    19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE  S-27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO DECEMBER 1997, THEN 4.80 PCT TO MATURITY</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 513</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
